  "description": "ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company building human-like voice and audio models, with hubs in London, New York, San Francisco, and Warsaw. Founded in 2022 by Mati Staniszewski and Piotr Dabkowski, it ships ElevenAgents for conversational voice and chat agents, ElevenCreative for speech, music, image, and video creation across 70+ languages, and ElevenAPI for developers. The company closed 2025 with more than $330 million in ARR, raised a $500 million Series D at an $11 billion valuation in February 2026, and has raised $781 million in total.",
